{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/3534-changeling-the-dreaming-author-comments","id":3534,"title":"Changeling: The Dreaming Author Comments","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-05T08:54:00-08:00","id":3534,"title":"Changeling: The Dreaming Author Comments","content":"This thread is to archive some of the author commentary from the previous White Wolf forums. I'll sort the comments by book. If anyone has anything else I don't have, please add it!<br /> <br /> <u><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Book of Glamour</b></span></u><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Krister M. Michl</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Actually, Book of Glamour was underway when CtD went on hiatus (and then ended). I had already completed my first drafts for the product when we got the message (and I assume that the same goes for Chris and Daniel). That said, it never went into redlining and second drafts.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PookaKnight</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Neat! Do you still have what you wrote?</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Krister M. Michl</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Yes, I do.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">I tend to save all my old work files so Book of Glamour is in there as well.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Krister M. Michl</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">I understand exactly what you guys are saying. As a [massive] Changeling fan I would love to see anything cancelled or cut that was meant to be &quot;official material&quot; at some point, but it's not as simple as that (to me).</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">First of all I'd want to have Richard Thomas and/or Eddy Webbs permission to show it.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Second, time changes perspectives. What I wrote ages years ago is nothing I deem fit to put online now. Now, would I find time to polish the first draft into something... readable... then by all means I wouldn't have anything against it.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">If I got both of these, then I wouldn't hesitate to post it.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">What I can tell you is that I had the section on Dark Glamour (how to gain it, what happens if you enjoy it too much, etc.) and a full chapter on a new [old] magic that came back to the Autumn Realm with the Second Resurgence.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">I will, as it is at least fun to see </span></span></span><i>something</i><span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">, show you the opening to the latter assignment (</span></span></span><b>though it's unedited and an unpolished FIRST draft version that's 10 years old</b><span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">).</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">&lt;i&gt;Loosely based on a true story, but aren't we all?</span></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">&lt;n&gt;\u2014 Joe Haldeman</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">&lt;n&gt;The World of Darkness is filled with different magical energies such as Gnosis, Quintessence, and Pathos, but for changelings Glamour allow them to create astonishing, sometimes breathtaking, magical exercises. With the Second Resurgence this changed as knowledge of lost runes resurfaced and tipped the balance in war and politics alike.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0BymGBI7sN3MsZGJlOGZiMTAtNWFlZS00ZjdjLTkwY2MtMmEyMDY3YzJiMzg0/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Dan Ginn's Daedalon Art</a><br /> <br /> <u><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Keys to the Kingdom</b></span></u><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0BymGBI7sN3MsNTJkNzhjN2YtZTcxMy00Y2VkLWFjYzktMDA2ZDk1ZDY4M2M4/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cyrrax by Chris Howard intended as the opening fiction</a><br /> <br /> <u><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><b>Time of Judgement</b></span></u><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0BymGBI7sN3MsMzk1NzhlMTItMDNmNi00ZDhmLWIxYmItYjk1NGQ4OTMyZDM5/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">House Danaan by Pete Woodworth cut for space along with forum commentary</a></span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":648,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","user":"PookaKnight","date":". 01-15-2014, 10:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-26T01:16:30-08:00","id":18270,"title":"","content":"I always wanted to see Changeling get their own mini book the way Vampire had Book of Nod and Werewolf had the Silver Record. Only it would be a complete book of changeling historic events written in Shakespearean prose. Maybe blue with a gilded gold ink printed gryphon like the stained glass image cover of the core books. Fragile Path did NOT hold up well to time with it's print job.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-26T07:56:53-08:00","id":18411,"title":"","content":"I would *love* to see a Book of Nod style Changeling book. I'm really hoping one could be a stretch goal for a hypothetical Changeling 20th Anniversary Kickstarter. I'd imagine it as a collection of stories an enterprising Kithain (maybe the historian from Way of the Commoner) wandered the world to gather - legends of the War of Trees, dreams of the current state of Arcadia, and prophecies from True Thomas, the sluagh from War in Concordia, and other seers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-27T04:40:56-08:00","id":19091,"title":"","content":"Guh... I have brain drool now as the very prospect. That would be so awesome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-27T08:47:28-08:00","id":19199,"title":"","content":"The discussion about gameline names got me a bit nostalgic for Changeling's history. The Wayback Machine has the old Changeling homepage archived! So, here are links to the developer chat transcripts from 2000 and 2001, Arthaus's heyday when Changeling felt like it was coming back in a big way right before the gameline was cancled.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20050210170936/http://www.white-wolf.com/games/pages/ChangelingChat101200.html\" target=\"_blank\">October 12, 2000</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20050322144829/http://www.white-wolf.com/Games/Pages/ChangelingChat2222001.html\" target=\"_blank\">February 22, 2001</a><br /> <br /> <br /> <b>EDIT</b>: And look! There's my old White Wolf site screen name, Julius_Patel <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":648,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","user":"PookaKnight","date":". 11-27-2013, 11:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-14T14:27:27-08:00","id":49295,"title":"","content":"hey Pooka Knight good to see you! You propably remeber me better as Jose_Mariposa, that was my old White WOlf Screen name back in the day. Thank you for posting these..","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>May you live in interesting times...</i><br /> <br /> Storyteller of <b><a href=\"https://sunforgedoath.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Sun Forged Oath</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1998-keichiokami","name":"Keichiokami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1998_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-14T15:39:33-08:00","id":49324,"title":"","content":"is it me- or that the link for the House Danaan leads to Cyrrax instead?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-15T07:41:59-08:00","id":49775,"title":"","content":"Thanks for letting me know. It's fixed now!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}